@SeoAuto.ReportService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5003
@ApiGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:8000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Ping Check (Direct)
GET {{SeoAuto.ReportService_HostAddress}}/api/reports/ping
Accept: text/plain

### 2. Ping via Gateway
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/reports/ping
Accept: text/plain

### 3. Create Project (via Gateway)
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "E-commerce Platform",
  "description": "Hệ thống website thương mại điện tử chính"
}

### 4. Get My Projects (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Project Detail (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Create Website in Project (via Gateway)
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/websites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "YOUR_PROJECT_ID_HERE",
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "name": "Example Storefront",
  "faviconUrl": "https://example.com/favicon.ico"
}

### 7. Get My Websites (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/websites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Websites by Project (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/websites?projectId=YOUR_PROJECT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Website Detail with Recent Audits (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/websites/YOUR_WEBSITE_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Report Detail By Id or AuditRequestId (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/reports/YOUR_REPORT_OR_AUDIT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Score History for Charts (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/reports/history?websiteId=YOUR_WEBSITE_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
